# water-controller (merged into /etc/mosquitto/acl by install.sh)
user water-controller
topic write water/+/flow
topic write water/+/sample
topic write water/+/valve
topic write water/+/rule
topic write water/+/alert
topic write water/+/state
topic readwrite water/+/status
topic read water/+/config
# the spare board (WATER_SPARE builds) publishes under water-spare/, which nothing ingests or bridges
topic write water-spare/#
topic read water-spare/+/config

user wc-ingest
topic read water/#

# Learned limits from the usage model (server/model/publish.py), retained; water-spare for hardware tests
user wc-model
topic write water/+/config
topic write water-spare/+/config
